        <xpdl2:Activity Id="_HOsLstJkEeqLn70Ph9PbVA" Name="PrecondizioneFallita" IsATransaction="false" xpdExt:Visibility="Private" xpdExt:RequireNewTransaction="false" xpdExt:DisplayName="Precondizione Fallita">
          <xpdl2:Implementation>
            <xpdl2:Task>
              <xpdl2:TaskScript>
                <xpdl2:Script ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">EsitoResponse = com_tim_NOW_xsd_ControlliAmmessi_Factory.createEsitoType();&#xD;
EsitoResponse.codice = true;&#xD;
EsitoResponse.descrizione = &quot;Verifica univocità ID VLAN OLO - Precondizione fallita&quot;;&#xD;
&#xD;
Process.auditLog(EsitoResponse.descrizione);</xpdl2:Script>
              </xpdl2:TaskScript>
            </xpdl2:Task>
          </xpdl2:Implementation>
          <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
            <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo BorderColor="0,0,128" FillColor="255,219,74" Height="64.0" LaneId="_sdHmodJjEeqLn70Ph9PbVA" Width="96.0">
              <xpdl2:Coordinates XCoordinate="571.0" YCoordinate="45.0"/>
            </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo>
          </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
          <xpdl2:Extensions/>
          <xpdExt:ActivityResourcePatterns>
            <xpdExt:AllocationStrategy xpdExt:Strategy="SYSTEM_DETERMINED"/>
          </xpdExt:ActivityResourcePatterns>
        </xpdl2:Activity>
        <xpdl2:Activity Id="_VL0N4tJkEeqLn70Ph9PbVA" Name="VerificaPrecondizione" IsATransaction="false" xpdExt:Visibility="Private" xpdExt:DisplayName="Verifica Precondizione" xpdExt:RequireNewTransaction="false">
          <xpdl2:Implementation>
            <xpdl2:Task>
              <xpdl2:TaskScript>
                <xpdl2:Script ScriptGrammar="JavaScript">eseguiControllo = false;&#xD;
&#xD;
if((localRequest.lavorazione == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_LavorazioneEnumeration.ATTIVAZIONE&#xD;
	&amp;&amp; (localRequest.offerta == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_OffertaEnumeration.VLANNGA&#xD;
	    || localRequest.offerta == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_OffertaEnumeration.VLAN&#xD;
	    || localRequest.offerta == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_OffertaEnumeration.VLANVULA&#xD;
   	    || localRequest.tipologiaSottolav == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_TipologiaSottolavorazioneEnumeration.PRIMOFEEDER))  //RU_1180&#xD;
  ||(localRequest.lavorazione == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_LavorazioneEnumeration.VARIAZIONE&#xD;
	&amp;&amp; localRequest.tipologiaSottolav == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_TipologiaSottolavorazioneEnumeration.VARIAZIONETDKIT&#xD;
    &amp;&amp; (localRequest.offerta == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_OffertaEnumeration.VLANNGA&#xD;
        || localRequest.offerta == it_telecomitalia_it_NOW_casedata_OffertaEnumeration.VLAN)))&#xD;
{&#xD;
	eseguiControllo = true;&#xD;
}</xpdl2:Script>
              </xpdl2:TaskScript>
            </xpdl2:Task>
          </xpdl2:Implementation>
          <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
            <xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo BorderColor="0,0,128" FillColor="255,219,74" Height="64.0" LaneId="_sdHmodJjEeqLn70Ph9PbVA" Width="96.0">
              <xpdl2:Coordinates XCoordinate="220.0" YCoordinate="155.0"/>
            </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfo>
          </xpdl2:NodeGraphicsInfos>
